{"date":"07-26","anniversaryYear":2026,"nameDays":{"cz":{"country":"cz","label":"Česko","language":"cs","heading":"Svátek má","names":[{"name":"Anna","note":null,"variantOf":null,"meaning":{"title":"Anna","aboutName":"Anna","extract":"Anna je ženské rodné jméno hebrejského původu (hebrejsky חַנָּה‎, Chana či Channa), které znamená „milostiplná“ či „milá“. Ze stejného hebrejského jména pochází také jména Hana a Hannah. V bibli se vyskytují dvě ženy s tímto jménem, matka proroka Samuela Chana z 1. knihy Samuelovy a v Novém zákoně prorokyně Anna, dcera Fanuelova z kmene Ašer která žila v Jeruzalémském Chrámu a očekávala příchod Mesiáše a rozpoznala ho v Ježíši.","url":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Anna&oldid=26071156","source":{"title":"Anna","wiki":"cs.wikipedia.org","revisionUrl":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Anna&oldid=26071156","historyUrl":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Anna&action=history","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.cs","fetchedAt":"2026-10-29T14:47:29+00:00"}},"bearer":{"name":"Anna Lucemburská","wikidataId":"Q170202","url":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anna_Lucembursk%C3%A1"}}],"otherNames":[{"name":"Anika","note":null},{"name":"Anita","note":null},{"name":"Gražyna","note":null},{"name":"Gražina","note":null},{"name":"Naneta","note":null}],"source":{"title":"26. červenec","wiki":"cs.wikipedia.org","revisionUrl":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=26._%C4%8Dervenec&oldid=26084331","historyUrl":"https://cs.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=26._%C4%8Dervenec&action=history","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.cs","fetchedAt":"2026-10-29T02:49:28+00:00"}},"sk":{"country":"sk","label":"Slovensko","language":"sk","heading":"Meniny má","names":[{"name":"Anna","note":null,"variantOf":null,"meaning":{"title":"Anna (prvé meno)","aboutName":"Anna","extract":"Anna je ženské krstné meno. Ide o novozákonné meno